    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[I haven't had time to update this game for a while, and as a result I'm making it free]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORDIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The premise of wordies is simple, you're randomly assigned the task of guessing a commonly used American word. But with only 5 tries, Wordies is harder than it </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> looks. Wordies also features a Daily Word &amp; a global highstreak leaderboard where you can compete with not only your friends but the rest of the world to be the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> When guessing you're given 3 different clues in the form of colors to help you along your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Gray</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter you've chosen does not appear in the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Orange</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter you've entered is in the word, but appears in a different place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Green</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter is in the correct place, but there is still the possibility of it appearing twice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build up winstreaks, fustrate yourself, &amp; challenge friends all in an hour of wordies!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[I haven't had time to update this game for a while, and as a result I'm making it free]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORDIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The premise of wordies is simple, you're randomly assigned the task of guessing a commonly used American word. But with only 5 tries, Wordies is harder than it </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> looks. Wordies also features a Daily Word &amp; a global highstreak leaderboard where you can compete with not only your friends but the rest of the world to be the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> When guessing you're given 3 different clues in the form of colors to help you along your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Gray</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter you've chosen does not appear in the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Orange</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter you've entered is in the word, but appears in a different place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Green</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter is in the correct place, but there is still the possibility of it appearing twice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build up winstreaks, fustrate yourself, &amp; challenge friends all in an hour of wordies!</p>",
    "short_description": "Wordies is bringing a word game you've most likely played &amp; enjoyed to Steam. But it's harder than before, with only 5 guesses you're given the not so easy task of guessing a common American word! Guess the daily word &amp; build up highstreaks to compete against the world in our global leaderboards!",
